OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FMostly dry
OL,6,Fthrough the evening with some bright
OL,7,Fspells at first. Then clouding
OL,8,Foveringht with some light and patchy
OL,9,Frain spreading east, drier later.
OL,10,
OL,11,CSunday:FOutbreaks of rain in the
OL,12,Fmorning then dry for a time before
OL,13,Ffurther showers in the evening. Fresh
OL,14,Fto strong southerly winds.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
